# SKOS component — intentionally empty.
#
# The STAC Accuracy extension (https://github.com/stac-extensions/accuracy, v1.0.0-beta.1)
# defines only free-numeric fields (biases, standard deviations, an RMSE, and two
# measurement-uncertainty fields). It introduces no enumeration, codelist, or controlled
# vocabulary, so there are no skos:Concept terms to mint for this extension. This file is
# kept as an explicit placeholder — paired with owl.ttl and combined into ontology.ttl — so
# the accuracy-ontology block follows the same split-file layout as its sibling ontology
# blocks, and so a future accuracy extension version that adds an enumerated field has an
# obvious place to add it.
